# Why `sheprd remote add-link` could not read a pairing link from standard
# input. The link itself is never shown.

error-link-input-empty = No pairing link on standard input; pipe it in
error-link-input-read = Could not read the pairing link from standard input
error-link-input-terminal = Standard input is a terminal; pipe the pairing link in so it is not shown
error-link-input-text = The pairing link on standard input is not text
error-link-input-too-long = Standard input holds more than 8192 bytes; no pairing link is that long
